I fixed the compile error by importing `AgentResponse` and `LlmError` from `crate::aap::caps::types`. I did not add the two operations requests. The node's `with` clause grants only `kb-read` and `tool-llm`, so a log-file write and an HTTP fetch would need capabilities this node does not have. Adding them would widen the node's authority beyond its graph declaration. Sending the customer's question to an external metadata service would also send untrusted user text off-platform. Those changes need to go through the graph definition and a review.

